#!/bin/sh
# Refuses a commit whose staged env files hold plaintext values or keys the
# Envfile does not declare. Install it for this clone only with
#   git config core.hooksPath .githooks
# See "The committed .env" in README.md.
root=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel) || exit 1
exec python3 "$root/scripts/check_env.py" --staged
